142| \begin{proposition}[Baldwin's rules]\label{prop:b3:radicals-carbenes:baldwin}
143| For ring closures (established experimentally, with a stereoelectronic
144| rationale): at a tetrahedral carbon (tet), 3- to 7-exo are favoured, 5- and
145| 6-endo disfavoured; at a trigonal carbon (trig), 3- to 7-exo are favoured, 3- to 5-endo
146| disfavoured, 6- and 7-endo favoured; at a digonal carbon (dig), 3- and 4-exo are
147| disfavoured, 5- to 7-exo favoured, 3- to 7-endo favoured.
148| \end{proposition}
